  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Equitable learning for inclusion and resilience</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to build resilience in education through developing knowledge products to support education leadership programmes. Toolkits will be developed, and technical assistance provided to member countries to aide implementation, promoting early learning and development of young children, more effective management of education systems and guidelines for education policy planners.??</narrative>
  </description>
